        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosibigwa kw’omonto obwate oborwaire bwa ukoma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oko nakwo ogochika ase omonto obwate oborwaire bwa ukoma. Ase rituko riria arabe agochenwa arentwe ase Omokuani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Omokuani agende isiko y’egetwori amorenge. Kararore ng’a omonto oria ogwenire korwa ase oborwaire bwa ukoma bwamoriete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani achike abanto barente chinyoni ibere chichenegete chire moyo, na oroko rw’omocharake, na eusi embariri, na orosagia rwa hisopo, ase engencho y’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omokuani achike abanto banyeenyete enyoni eyemo igoro ase egetega ki’amaroba kere namaache amaya a rooche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aimokie enyoni eria ere moyo amo noroko rw’omocharake, na eusi eyio embariri, na orosagia orwo rwa hisopo, abitobeke ime ase amanyinga ’enyoni eria yanyeenyetetwe igoro y’amaache aria amaya a rooche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyororokerie amanyinga aria ara gatano na kabere igoro ase omonto oyio ogochia gochenwa ase oborwaire bwa ukoma, ateebe ng’a omonto oria ochenekire, na atige enyoni eria ere moyo eiruruke, egende orosana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria ogochia gochenwa goika asibie chianga chiaye, na akigite etukia yaye yonsi, naende esibie omobere namaache, erio abe oyochenegete. Magega y’ayio asoe ase egetwori, korende abeere isiko y’eema yaye ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere naende akigite etukia yaye yonsi y’omotwe, ne chinderu, na ebioge bi’amaiso, na amarionya ande onsi are ase omobere oye. Erio asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, na igo nabe ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase rituko ria gatano na gatato arente chimanwa ibere chimingichi chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo, na emaanwa esigiti yakoorire omwaka oyomo, etari na kemocho ase omobere oye, amo nobosie obonuke, ebimunu bitano na ekemo, bwochoganirie namaguta, ebe okoruegwa kw’endagera. Amo nayio arente amaguta egetuba ekemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani otenenerete arente omonto oria ogochia gochenwa amo nokoruegwa okwo ase obosio bwane inche Omonene, agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omokuani oria aimokie emaanwa eyemo, ayerue ebe ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha, ayerue amo namaguta egetuba ekemo, erio abisungusie agwo ase obosio bwane bibe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosungusigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyeenyere emaanwa eria agwo aase achenire, ase ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe na eki’ogosaambwa bikonyeenyerwa, ekiagera ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha neki’Omokuani; ekio negechenu mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani aimokie amanyinga make ay’ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha, na agindie mesia y’ogoto kwa borio kw’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa, naende agindie ekiara ekenene gi’okoboko kwaye kwa borio, na ekiara ekenene gi’okogoro kwaye kwa borio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omokuani aimokie amaguta aria ataaere oroe rw’okoboko kwaye gw’okobee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atobeke ekiara kiaye gi’okoraga gi’okoboko kwaye kwa borio ime ase amaguta aria are roe rw’okoboko kwaye gw’okobee, erio ayanyororokerie ara gatano na kabere, agwo ase obosio bwane inche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaguta make ase ayio agotigara ase oroe rwaye ayagindie mesia y’ogoto kwa borio kw’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa, na ekiara ekenene gi’okoboko kwaye kwa borio, na ekiara ekenene gi’okogoro kwaye kwa borio, igoro ase amanyinga ’ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha agindirieo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende maguta ayagotigara ase oroe rwaye ayaumore igoro ase omotwe bw’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa. Ase enchera eyio Omokuani akore okobwatanigwa ase omonto oria agwo ase obosio bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio Omokuani arue ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, akore okobwatanigwa ase omonto oria ogochia gochenwa, acheneke korwa ase ogotacheneka kwaye. Magega y’ayio anyenye ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akerue amo nokoruegwa kw’endagera ase egesasiimero. Ase enchera eyio Omokuani akore okobwatanigwa ase omonto oria, na omonto oria abe oyochenegete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende onye omonto oria ore omotaka na takonyara konyora ebinge akorua, rirorio arente emaanwa emingichi ebe ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha kegosungusigwa ase okobwatanigwa kwaye. Boigo arente obosie ebimunu bibere bwochoganirie namaguta, bobe okoruegwa kw’endagera, na amaguta egetuba ekemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo arente amaruma abere, gose amage ’amaruma abere, buna aranyare. Erimo ribe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, na erinde eki’ogosaambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na gatato arente ebinto ebio bi’ogochenwa kwaye ase Omokuani, agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano, ase obosio bwane inche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani aimokie emaanwa y’eng’ondi eria y’ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha, amo namaguta aria egetuba ekemo, abinduere inche Omonene bibe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosungusigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio anyenye emaanwa eria ebe ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha, na Omokuani aimokie amanyinga make ay’ekeng’wanso ekio, ayagindie mesia y’ogoto kwa borio kw’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa, na ekiara ekenene gi’okoboko kwaye kwa borio, na ekiara ekenene gi’okogoro kwaye kwa borio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani ataaere amaguta ase oroe rw’okoboko kwaye gw’okobee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make ay’amaguta aria are roe rw’okoboko kwaye gw’okobee ayanyororokerie ara gatano na kabere nekiara gi’okoraga gi’okoboko kwaye kwa borio, agwo ase obosio bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende make ay’amaguta ayio are roe rwaye agindie igoro ase amanyinga ’ekeng’wanso gi’okomocha agindire: Mesia y’ogoto kwa borio kw’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa, na ekiara ekenene gi’okoboko kwaye kwa borio, na ekiara ekenene gi’okogoro kwaye kwa borio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaguta agotigara ase oroe rwaye ayaumore ase omotwe bw’omonto oria ogochia gochenwa. Ase enchera eyio akore okobwatanigwa asare, agwo ase obosio bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omonto oria arue riruma gose riige rie riruma, koreng’ana buna aranyare koyanyora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erimo ribe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, na erinde eki’ogosaambwa, ayarue amo nokoruegwa kw’endagera. Ase enchera eyio Omokuani akore okobwatanigwa ase obosio bwane ase omonto oria ogochia gochenwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo ogochika ase omonto obwate oborwaire bwa ukoma, oria otanyare korua ebing’wanso bi’ogochenwa bia botaambe bichikiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ukoma ase chinyomba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agakwana na Musa na Aroni, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero moraike ase ense ya Kaanani, eyio ndabae ebe eyaino, na kondarente ukoma ase enyomba gete agwo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omonto omonyene enyomba eria agende ateebie Omokuani: Yarorekanire ase enyomba yane ng’a ukoma mboreo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani achike ng’a ebinto bionsi bire ase enyomba eyio birusigweo ritang’ani atarasoao koborenga. Onye tibagokora bo rirorio ebinto bionsi bire nyomba ime nabibe bitachenegeti. Magega y’ayio Omokuani asoe ase enyomba eyio koyerenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karayerenge na arore ng’a egetamase nkere ase enyasi y’enyomba eyio kere nekieni buna obonyansi, gose ekebariri, naende giakorire engoro gochia ime goetania rioomo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio Omokuani asoke korwa ase enyomba eyio, na ayesieke ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere Omokuani airaneo, ayerenge naende. Kararore ng’a ukoma boria bwesiareire ase enyasi y’enyomba eria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achike ng’a amagena aria asoirwe na ukoma atagorwe, atugutwe ase eubi egotugutwa, isiko y’omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio chinyasi chionsi chia ime chiomorwe, erio amaoomo atugutwe aase are neubi isiko y’omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagena ande arentwe, abekwe ribaga ri’aria atagorwa na gotugutwa, ne chinyasi, chioomwe nesike enyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ukoma boria koboratuboke naende ase enyomba eria magega amagena aria karusigweo, ne rioomo riria koriaoomoirwe, na enyomba eria yaoomirwe naende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani agende ayerenge naende. Onye egetamase keria giesiareire ase enyomba eria, obwo noukoma, yabeire eyetachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba eria etagorwe, na amagena onsi amo nemete ne rioomo riaye rionsi biimokigwe, bionsi biirwe ase eubi egotugutwa isiko y’omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde bwensi orasoe ase enyomba eyio, ekero egendererete gosiekwa, nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde bwensi aise koraara ime ase enyomba eyio, gose koragerera aroro, goika asibie chianga chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende Omokuani karachiche ayerenge arore ng’a ukoma boria tibwesiarereti magega koyaoomirwe, rirorio ukoma bwaerire, na ere ateebe ng’a enyomba eria yachenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani arente chinyoni ibere amo noroko rw’omocharake, na eusi embariri, na orosagia rwa hisopo, ase ogochenwa kw’enyomba eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio anyeenyete enyoni eyemo igoro ase egetega keroiseirie amaroba kere namaache amaya a rooche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aimokie oroko orwo rw’omocharake, na orosagia rwa hisopo, na eusi eria embariri amo nenyoni eria ere moyo, abitobeke bionsi ime ase amanyinga ’enyoni eria yanyenyetwe, na amaache aria amaya a rooche; erio anyororokerie enyomba eria ara gatano na kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enchera eyio Omokuani nachene enyomba eyio namanyinga ’enyoni eria, amo namaache aria amaya a rooche, na enyoni eria ere moyo, na oroko rw’omocharake, na orosagia rwa hisopo, na eusi eria embariri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omokuani atige enyoni eria ere moyo eiruruke, egende orosana isiko y’omochie. Ase enchera eyio akore okobwatanigwa ase enyomba eria, na ero ebe yachenekire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo ogochika igoro y’oborwaire bwa ukoma, ne richoncho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ukoma bore ase chianga, gose ase chinyomba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende obobimbu bwe risankwa, na ebisambo, na ebimoa ebirabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogochika okwo nigo gokworokia onye ebinto tibichenegeti gose mbichenegete. Okwo nogochika gwa ukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
